{"id":"n15101-1-13","stage":1,"title":"언어 · 语言","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15101-1-13-1","ko":"이 말은 어느 나라 말이에요?","zh":"这是哪个国家的语言啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"말은","meaning":"语言，话","explanation":"말：语言，话；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"3","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말은","audio":"/audio/4353d67e9824943836b4.mp3"}},{"text":"어느","meaning":"哪，哪个","explanation":"어느：哪，哪个","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"3","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}},{"text":"나라","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}},{"text":"말이에요?","meaning":"语言，话","explanation":"말：语言，话；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"3","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이에요","audio":"/audio/eb49aaa0268bb74f5d29.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"语言，话","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的声音和文字。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"哪，哪个","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"不管任何人或物。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]}],"audio":"/audio/59a4b48413f5cd768e1c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15101-1-13-2","ko":"그건 중동 사람들이 사용하는 언어란다.","zh":"那是中东人使用的语言哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그건","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"1","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그건","audio":"/audio/cf51c782be532a251c41.mp3"}},{"text":"중동","meaning":"中东","explanation":"중동：中东","readings":[{"term":"중동","audio":"/audio/0e146993d01decb1a471.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중동","audio":"/audio/0e146993d01decb1a471.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"사용하는","meaning":"使用，用，应用","explanation":"사용하다：使用，用，应用；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"사용하다","audio":"/audio/5b5903acacdca3b885c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61643","senseId":"1","lemma":"사용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사용하는","audio":"/audio/06f7558ae936582a6670.mp3"}},{"text":"언어란다.","meaning":"语言；表示引用。","explanation":"언어：语言；하다：表示引用。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"언어","audio":"/audio/d870406c5d15f996b167.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15101","senseId":"1","lemma":"언어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언어란다","audio":"/audio/9c7d10f6a2eb9549894b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5b5903acacdca3b8","term":"사용하다","zh":"使用，用，应用","audio":"/audio/5b5903acacdca3b885c9.mp3","entryId":"61643","definition":"按照情况或功能上的需要而利用。","pronunciation":["사ː용하다"]},{"id":"d870406c5d15f996","term":"언어","zh":"语言","audio":"/audio/d870406c5d15f996b167.mp3","entryId":"15101","definition":"表达想法或感觉等，或传达声音或文字等的方式；或指那个体系。","pronunciation":["어너"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/45e32b061695712b0ba2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15101","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1451,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那是中东人使用的语言哦。","那个人好像五音不全。","这是哪个国家的语言啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那是中东人使用的语言哦。","这是哪个国家的语言啊？","那个人好像五音不全。"],"answer":0}]}
